{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026y1fTS5Wprx1794929491.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國總統特朗普到菲律賓參加峰會之際，當地有示威反對他到訪。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.PHIL.PROTEST-2300-1_CLEAN_20261117_230649_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026dmxuzlXrg21794929505.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>馬尼拉市中心一個廣場附近，周二有約1,500人集會，示威者手舉標語與橫額、高叫口號，要求特朗普離開菲律賓，警察手持防暴盾牌在現場維持秩序。有人呼籲當局堅持獨立外交政策，停止被美國操控。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.PHIL.PROTEST-2300-1_CLEAN_20261117_230649_004.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026BLOi4c051X1794929531.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>有示威者表示，擔心美國利用菲律賓與中國的衝突，加強當地駐軍或增設更多軍事基地，憂慮一旦特朗普與中方達成協議或和解，菲律賓將處於尷尬境地。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T16:37:33.611029+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":191,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T15:05:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T22:35:11.748087+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T16:30:42.801419+00:00","content_hash":"4b0a8d9c5677a054266296ecec2250cb4da3f96578cc2fc733e5a62249bb770c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}